-->

### Tags
```hcl
locals {
  tags = merge(var.env_default_tags, var.tags)
}
```

### Data sources
```hcl
data "aws_caller_identity" "current" {}
data "aws_region" "current" {}
```
Use these to access `account_id` and `region` at runtime — never hardcode.

### Resource identifiers
- Single resources: `"default"` (e.g., `aws_s3_bucket.default`)
- Multiple resources: `for_each` with descriptive map keys

